/**
 * PostgresStore — the cloud persistence adapter.
 *
 * Implements the same Store contract as SqliteStore over `pg`, so flipping
 * DEPLOY_MODE to cloud is a wiring change, not a code change (ISC-58). It runs
 * the same portable DDL from schema.ts and the same `ON CONFLICT` upserts; only
 * the placeholder dialect differs ($1..$n here vs ? in SQLite). Every tenant
 * query is scoped by user_id (ISC-49).
 *
 * This adapter must COMPILE and pass the shared store suite; it is not the local
 * runtime default.
 */

